#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.rst:4
msgid "Changelog — v5"
msgstr "更新日志 — v5"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every OpenMV IDE v5.x.x release brings new features and improvements. Here's"
" what changed in each one — new editor, camera, and tooling features, bug "
"fixes, and platform support. Releases are listed newest first; click a "
"version to open its changelog."
msgstr ""
"每个 OpenMV IDE v5.x.x 版本都带来了新功能和改进。以下是每个版本的更改内容 — "
"新的编辑器、相机和工具功能、错误修复以及平台支持。版本按从新到旧的顺序列出；点击某个版本即可打开其更新日志。"

